! This test calculates the CC energy with the X2C Hamiltonian                                       
**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
LiO molecule. X2C Hamiltonian. CC energies.                                                         
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
**HAMILTONIAN                                                                                       
.X2C                                                                                                
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACT                                                                                         
**WAVE FUNCTIONS                                                                                    
.SCF                                                                                                
.RELCCSD                                                                                            
*SCF                                                                                                
.CLOSED SHELL                                                                                       
10                                                                                                  
.OPEN SHELL                                                                                         
1                                                                                                   
1 / 2                                                                                               
.EVCCNV                                                                                             
1.0E-9 1.0E-7                                                                                       
**MOLTRA                                                                                            
.EXACORR                                                                                            
.ACTIVE                                                                                             
energy -5.0 1.0 0.01                                                                                
.PRINT                                                                                              
1                                                                                                   
.CHOLESKY                                                                                           
1.0D-6                                                                                              
**RELCCSD                                                                                           
.NELEC_OPEN                                                                                         
1 0                                                                                                 
.DEBUG                                                                                              
.INTERFACE                                                                                          
DIRAC                                                                                               
.PRINT                                                                                              
1                                                                                                   
*END OF                                                                                             


